    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41309" root="همر" body-key="h">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَمَرَهُ</span></b> , (S, A, K,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَمُرَ</span></b>  (S, K) and 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَمِرَ</span></b> , (K,)
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَمْرٌ</span>, (S,) <i>He,</i> or <i>it, poured it;
out</i> or <i>forth;</i> (S, A, K;) namely, water, (S,
TA,) and tears, and rain, and the like. (TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَمَرَ مَا فِى الضَّرْعِ</span> <i>He drew forth all the milk
that was in the udder.</i> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَمَرَ لَهُ مِنْ مَالِهِ</span>
(assumed tropical:)  <i>He gave to him of his property.</i> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَمَرَ الكَلَامَ</span>, (K,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فى كَلَامِهِ</span>, (A,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَمُرَ</span></b> ,
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَمْرٌ</span>: (TA;) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِالكَلَامِ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِنْهَمَرَ</span></b> ; (S;)
(tropical:)  <i>He talked much.</i> (K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَمَرَ</span>, intrans.: see
7. in two places.

